          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "Description: On August 8, 2013, around 11:10-15 PM, two individuals in an apartment heard a fairly intense and constant noise and observed the low-altitude passage of a dark, rectangular object they did not recognize. Red and white lights were seen. Given the collected elements, namely the lights, distance, and size compatible with a military cargo plane, the typical noise of such an aircraft, the gray color, the indefinable shape against the night sky, the corresponding flight path, and a plane having already used it, we can conclude that the PAN observed by the witnesses is very likely a military cargo plane, an A400M, approaching the Vélizy-Villacoublay airport (see the investigation report). This case is of very good consistency: two witnesses made two statements to the Gendarmerie and the GEIPAN, each with detailed and illustrated sketches; however, no photographic or video documents exist. The observation is ultimately not strange, as it involves a ultimately mundane object, but observed under unusual conditions, as it is not frequent. This case should be classified as \"B,\" indicating a very probable observation of a military cargo plane.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "0dac587318e45ca9dcd3a1b912b88c111fbba6c4e10ef217d4cd379b5380adc8"
        }
